\v 24 [And he gathered]{strong=“H6908” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w men| strong="H582" \w* [unto him, and became captain]{strong=“H8269”} \w over a band| strong="H1416" \w*, \w when David| strong="H1732" \w* [slew]{strong=“H2026” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} them of Zobah: [and they went]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to Damascus| strong="H1834" \w*, [and dwelt]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [therein, and reigned]{strong=“H4427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w in Damascus| strong="H1834" \w*. 
\v 25 \w And he was an adversary| strong="H7854" \w* \w to Israel| strong="H3478" \w* \w all the days| strong="H3117" \w* \w of Solomon| strong="H8010" \w*, \w beside the mischief| strong="H7451" \w* \w that Hadad| strong="H1908" \w* did: [and he abhorred]{strong=“H6973” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w Israel| strong="H3478" \w*, [and reigned]{strong=“H4427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w over Syria| strong="H758" \w*. 
\p
