\v 28 \w And the man| strong="H376" \w* \w Jeroboam| strong="H3379" \w* was \w a mighty man| strong="H1368" \w* \w of valour| strong="H2428" \w*: \w and Solomon| strong="H8010" \w* [seeing ]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the young man| strong="H5288" \w* [that he was industrious]{strong=“H4399 H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [he made him ruler]{strong=“H6485” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w over all the charge| strong="H5447" \w* \w of the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Joseph| strong="H3130" \w*.\f + \fr 11:28 \ft was industrious: Heb. did work \f* \f + \fr 11:28 \ft charge: Heb. burden \f* 
\v 29 \w And it came to pass at that time| strong="H6256" \w* \w when Jeroboam| strong="H3379" \w* [went out]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w of Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w*, \w that the prophet| strong="H5030" \w* \w Ahijah| strong="H281" \w* \w the Shilonite| strong="H7888" \w* [found]{strong=“H4672” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w him in the way| strong="H1870" \w*; [and he had clad]{strong=“H3680” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8693”} \w himself with a new| strong="H2319" \w* \w garment| strong="H8008" \w*; \w and they two| strong="H8147" \w* were \w alone in the field| strong="H7704" \w*: 
